// Every limit of the integers and of the floats C++ has macros for, as
// `pub eval` bindings: host.cc reads them as constant expressions through
// `#include "limits_lib.k"` and checks each against clang's own
// <limits.h> / <float.h> macros. Generated; see use.k.

